> BTW, I'm still new to rgrn.  What is killfile?

A killfile is a general usenet thing, not specific to rgrn.

If there is someone who is posting things you don't want to read you put 
their name in the killfile and your newsreader will ignore all their posts 
(in other words, you don't read the posts of someone you put in your 
killfile).

Another interesting thing to know is "Plonk" (or variations if it) which is 
the sound someone makes when they go into a killfile.

